{"v":4,"catch":"突襲核心（首都大陸）。","desc":"《ASSAULT》是 NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於 1988 年發行的射擊遊戲。\nSYSTEM II遊戲電路板的第一個標題，具有“放大、縮小和旋轉功能”等新功能。\n控制你的坦克並與入侵者作戰，奪回你的家園。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-09-29","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/65b5f22cdf928b8ddc124c4cdf898a5d5580d6259590f062261205b9ca68ff5a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e2f8c74dde53d0382f8d0fdbff217cfdf6c219bd304e3e6a24d952a84a6c0521.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5c8c9bb18e29fafe1410bc8c6f130f4f4272390560d9739d2c06ff06fc9182ec.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/395f52538081ea92aa7e3d71de071ab4b2c0b467322b4f97d1d9136c01c84a5d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/20d3edad79c17b901fcc2224d04c9cdcf3ee1ac202a269f2998b727f7e8f252e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/eefcda3a7eed9667b773698f75cde9e42d9800d5867b45bad7df2cead456a44d.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f85018b94000","dlc":[]}